# GDScript conventions

## Avoid brittle `res://` paths

- Prefer `class_name` for shared scripts
- Prefer `@export` / PackedScene refs set in the editor
- Prefer relative `preload("sibling.gd")` only when colocated

## Naming

- Signals: `ev_*`
- Files: `snake_case.gd`; scene colocated
- Types: `PascalCase` + `class_name`
- FSM state IDs: `static func get_state() -> String`

## Patterns

- Wire with `@export` (editor-first)
- UI in the editor; scripts update existing nodes
- Pure logic → `RefCounted`
- Signal subscriptions → `EventListener`; tear down in `deinit`
- Config copies → `ResourceUtils.update_resource()`

## Must

- Feature code in `src/features/{name}/`
- `core/` must not reference `src/`
- Every `.tscn` runs isolated (F6) with `.tres` defaults

## Avoid

- Autoloads for flow (`RootEvents` / `GameEvents` instead)
- Cross-feature internal imports
- Parallel FSM beside match `GameManager`
